						 <p>I always feel squee when one of my favorite Foundation authors answers me on a forum. ^_^</p> <p>That said, could you also enlighten me at Denouement?<br /> <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/forum/t-734028/wayward-denouement">http://www.scp-wiki.net/forum/t-734028/wayward-denouement</a></p> 
