					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-473594#post-2211050</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-473594/parable-of-the-wayward-prince#post-2211050</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Mon, 19 Jan 2015 14:40:10 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Eskobar</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1173523</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>It's a series of references to some of the goofy anti-lolfoundation tales that were written in 2011-12; in order, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/poopstick-mcgee-and-the-flying-walruses">this one</a> and <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/the-death-of-alto-clef-etc">this one</a>. And Fifteve is 055, yes; specifically, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/revenants">this story</a> involving it, which has always been one of my favorites.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
